    "title": "【課務組】期末「教學意見調查表」系統將自5月18日(日)起開放，完成填答的同學將有機會獲得兩百元超商禮券!  NDHU Teaching Feedback System will open on May 18. Students who filled out the feedback will enter a lucky draw for the chance of winning a NTD$200 gift certificate!",
